      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُبَاشَةٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبَاشَةٌ</span>; (S, K;) i. e. <i>What is collected,</i> of men, and of property: (S, TA:) <i>a
company,</i> or <i>body, of men, not of one tribe:</i> (TA,
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حبش</span>:) and <i>what one gains</i> or <i>earns, and
collects,</i> of property: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُبَاشَاتٌ</span>. (TA.)

